# A scheduled prompt, step by step

:::: {.boxes look="line"}
::: box
### When
Every Monday at 8:00
:::
::: box
### What it reads
The week's new emails
:::
::: box
### What it writes
Three groups and two drafts
:::
::: box
### Who it tells
You, in one message
:::
::::
```

The first agent most people use is a prompt that runs on a schedule.

