# Which tool for which data

| Data | In the chat | In Excel |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Public | Yes | Yes |
| Anonymous | With an approved tool | Yes |
| Internal | Company account only | Yes, on a copy |
```

The table every team asks for first. Fill in your own company's tools.

